!data/raw/.gitkeep
# The NEA rainfall store (~18 MB of Parquet, 2017 onward) is committed so the app can replay any
# date and nobody has to rebuild it. Raw CSVs, sightings and the manifest stay local.
!data/raw/rainfall/
data/raw/rainfall/*
!data/raw/rainfall/readings/
!data/raw/rainfall/readings/**
!data/raw/rainfall/stations.parquet
